  _comments:
  - _text: Been skeptical on the whole VR concerts thing. My son convinced me to try, maybe they're not too bad after all!
    _priority: 8
  - _text: Better than some live shows I've been too (that's how you know I'm old lmao)
    _priority: 10
  - _text: best show i've been to all year
    _priority: 2
  - _text: They're always playing these old ass rock songs. Like we get it, you are very distinguished and educated...
    _priority: 6
  - _text: who else got goosebumps??
    _priority: 2
  - _text: VR moshpit > Real moshpit, fight me.
    _priority: 5
  - _text: ok but that second song tho
    _priority: 2
  - _text: Shout out to spoteefy.ai for recommending me this! It knows me far too well, lol!
    _priority: 9
  - _text: Kinda sad that I'll never hear these songs again, this rocks. It was so simple to relisten to something back in the day...
    _priority: 10
  - _text: 11/10 would attend again
    _priority: 1
  - _text: My knees are too old for real concert crowds these days anyway, might just stick to VR from now on, this was way better than I expected.
    _priority: 7
  - _text: need the setlist asap
    _priority: 3
  - _text: didn't expect to cry tonight
    _priority: 2
  - _text: I remember when video games were just pixels on a screen, now I'm standing at a virtual concert, so awesome!
    _priority: 7
  - _text: you're going places fr
    _priority: 1
  - _text: Imagine showing this to somebody 30 years ago.
    _priority: 6
  - _text: Got the 2010 vibes from thissss (idk I wasn't alive back then)
    _priority: 6
  _priorityShuffle: 3
  _commentsShown: 4
